---
// C-020 — no theme picker, because there is no second theme to pick.
//
// This override exists to REMOVE Starlight's control, never to reimplement it.
// Its stock version renders a `<starlight-theme-select>` custom element with a
// dark/light/auto `<select>`, plus a second inline script that writes
// `localStorage.setItem('starlight-theme', …)`. Rendering nothing takes out
// both the control and that write.
//
// Starlight mounts this component in two places — the header's right group and
// the mobile menu footer — so one override empties both. Removing it from the
// header alone would leave the picker alive on narrow viewports.
---
